QuestGuidance.Register("es",76,{
[2401]="70053DBB\n1\tDefeat dire-horns in Rath Dúath (total: 6)\030Defeat Skrithras\tDire-horns can be found in Rath Dúath. You should find and defeat Skrithras, along with other dire-horn goats.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated dire-horns.\n",
[2402]="7001C072\n1\tLleva las setas a Glaednoth\030Recolecta setas empapadas (total: 10)\tLas setas empapadas se pueden encontrar en las ruinas al oeste de Ost Haer. Glaednoth se encuentra en las ruinas de Ost Haer, en la zona sur de Harloeg. Glaednoth te ha pedido que busques setas empapadas para intentar preparar un plato interesante con ellas. NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son misiones repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión se puede completar tres veces.\n",
[2403]="70071B40\n1\tDerrota a Strákhal el Estrangulador\tA bounty notice asks you to defeat a vicious Orc named Strákhal in Fushaum Sûlm in southern Adagím, and collect a trophy as proof.\n2\tReturn to Sálunath with proof of Strákhal's demise\tYou defeated Strákhal the Strangler and obtained a trophy as proof. Return to Sálunath in Sul Madásh to collect the bounty.\n",
[2404]="7006BF7A\n1\tDerrota a Suginzi y recoge uno de sus grandes colmillos\tMizâdi Shâra, Reina del Nuevo Hamât, ha publicado una recompensa buscando cazadores expertos para encontrar y derrotar al gran jabalí de la plaga, Suginzi. Debes derrotarlo y regresar con su Mano, Numûru, con uno de sus grandes colmillos. Se le vio por última vez al suroeste de Urmâkh, cerca de Shakhdag.\n2\tBring Suginzi's great tusk to Numûru in Urmâkh\tBring Suginzi's great tusk to Numûru in Urmâkh to collect your reward.\n",
[2405]="700358D0\n1\tDerrota a Sulmus y recoge su silla de montar\tPuedes encontrar a Sulmus en Los Barbechos si tomas el camino directamente hacia el sur y luego buscas presas devoradas al sur de la primera bifurcación del camino. Debes invocar y derrotar a Sulmus, y recoger su silla de montar.\n2\tLleva la silla de montar a Britric\tBritric está en Forlaw. Has recogido la silla de montar de Sulmus, y ahora debes regresar a Forlaw para cobrar tu recompensa.\n",
[2406]="70071B42\n1\tDerrota a Sóthadar el Embaucador\tA bounty notice asks you to defeat a cunning bog-lurker known as Sóthadar who roams Lhámuth in Adagím, and collect a trophy as proof.\n2\tReturn to Sálunath with proof of Sóthadar's demise\tYou defeated Sóthadar the Trickster and obtained a trophy as proof. Return to Sálunath in Sul Madásh to collect the bounty.\n",
[2407]="7006BF71\n1\tDefeat Tamâhu and collect her mighty stinger\tMizâdi Shâra, Queen of Renewed Hamât, has posted a bounty seeking skilled hunters to defeat the dread scorpion Tamâhu and return with her mighty stinger. She has last been seen west of Urmâkh, near Dûlagig.\n2\tBring Tamâhu's stinger to Numûru in Urmâkh\tBring Tamâhu's stinger to Numûru in Urmâkh to collect your reward.\n",
[2408]="7005976A\n1\tInvoca y enfréntate a Tansy Piesdeliebre\tTansy Piesdeliebre se encuentra en Guardasur, en el Bosque Salvaje. Deberías invocar y enfrentarte a Tansy Piesdeliebre.\n2\tCompletado\tTansy Piesdeliebre derrotada\n",
[2409]="7003FF77\n1\tTalk to Calennen\tCalennen can be found in central Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale. You have found a bounty posted for Tarlang's Fang and should now seek Calennen for more information.\n2\tDefeat Tarlang's Fang\tTarlang's Fang can be found somewhere in the hills to the south of the Hill of Erech. Calennen has given you all the information he has about the whereabouts of the fierce mountain-lion. You should now track and slay Tarlang's Fang.\n3\tTalk to Calennen\tCalennen can be found in central Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale. You have slain the fierce mountain-lion known as Tarlang's Fang and should now report your success to Calennen.\n",
[2410]="70071B41\n1\tDerrota a Thagára\tA bounty notice asks you to defeat a deadly crocodile named Thagára, who roams the Lair of the Shadlúgai in Adagím, and collect a trophy as proof.\n2\tReturn to Sálunath with proof of Thagára's demise\tYou defeated Thagára and obtained a trophy as proof. Return to Sálunath in Sul Madásh to collect the bounty.\n",
[2411]="70009A0D\n1\tHabla con Rowena Guardacotos en Ost Forod\tRowena Guardacotos está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech. Un cartel que ofrece una recompensa por la captura o derrota de un huargo cruel llamado Thauk llamó tu atención. Si deseas solicitar esta recompensa, debes hablar con Rowena Guardacotos.\n2\tDerrota a Thauk en Tûm Fuin\tEl huargo Thauk está en el campamento de trasgos de Tûm Fuin, al norte de Ost Forod. Has aceptado la comisión de la recompensa por Thauk.\n3\tHabla con Rowena Guardacotos en Ost Forod\tRowena Guardacotos está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech. Has derrotado al huargo Thauk y ahora debes informar a Rowena Guardacotos.\n4\tHabla con Basilio Resinas en Ost Forod\tBasilio Resinas está en Ost Forod, el antiguo puesto de vigilancia en las colinas de Tyrn Fornech. Has derrotado a Thauk y ahora debes informar a Basilio Resinas para recibir tu recompensa.\n",
[2412]="70044C15\n1\tDerrota a la Espada Negra de Lebennin\tThe most powerful of Sauron's forces have seized Osgiliath and must be weakened before they can reach Minas Tirith.\n",
[2413]="7001B251\n1\tEntrega los colmillos a Sage Semilleno\030Recolecta colmillos perfectos de jabalí (total: 10)\tLos jabalíes pueden encontrarse en los campos más septentrionales de Bree. Sage Semilleno te pidió que cazaras jabalíes para obtener sus colmillos y se los entregaras en el campamento cerca de los lagos en los campos del norte de Bree. NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.\n",
[2414]="70044F24\n1\tDerrota al Despojador Proscrito\tThe most powerful of Sauron's forces must be defeated if Gondor is to win the battle.\n",
[2415]="70044C17\n1\tDefeat Lúmithil\tThe most powerful of Sauron's forces have seized Osgiliath and must be weakened before they can reach Minas Tirith.\n",
[2416]="70044F8C\n1\tDerrota a la Languidez de Nurn\tThe Gloom of Nurn seeks to claim the crown of the King for Gothmog, who has returned to reclaim the throne of Gondor after his long absence.\n",
[2417]="70044C16\n1\tDefeat Muzgásh\tThe most powerful of Sauron's forces have seized Osgiliath and must be weakened before they can reach Minas Tirith.\n",
[2418]="7003FF76\n1\tTalk to Dírion\tDírion can be found in Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale. You have found a posted bounty for a white stag in Blackroot Vale, and should now speak to Dírion for more information.\n2\tSearch for the white stag in Blackroot Vale\tThe white stag was last seen somewhere in eastern Blackroot Vale. Dírion offered you some advice on where to track the white stag, and you should now seek it out.\n3\tPursue and capture the white stag\tYou should follow the white stag as it flees in eastern Blackroot Vale. The white stag has fled from your approach, but if you give chase, it is possible you might still catch it.\n4\tTalk to Dírion\tDírion can be found in Alagrant in western Blackroot Vale. You were unable to capture the stag due to its agility, but should report back to Dírion in Alagrant.\n",
[2419]="70059774\n1\tInvoca y enfréntate a Thunash\tThunash se encuentra en Cotfast, en el Bosque Salvaje. Deberías invocar a Thunash y enfrentarte a él.\n2\tCompletado\tHas derrotado a Thunash\n",
[2420]="70053DB8\n1\tDefeat trolls in Parth Daenath (total: 6)\030Defeat Fuluk in Parth Daenath\tTrolls can be found in Parth Daenath, as can the fearsome beast Fuluk. You should defeat trolls.\n2\tCompletado\tYou defeated trolls, as well as the fearsome Fuluk.\n",
[2421]="7006C6CF\n1\tDefeat Tukûrga\tA bounty notice in Ub Nishir has asked for someone to defeat the kergrim Tukûrga in Tûkurdul to the north-west, near Ashâgir.\n2\tReturn to Neshurga and inform him of Tukûrga's defeat\tReturn to Neshurga in Ub Nishir north of Maurûsh and inform him that you have completed the bounty and defeated Tukûrga.\n",
[2422]="7001B22A\n1\tLleva los caparazones a Walt Rosablanca\030Recolecta caparazones gruesos de tortuga (total: 10)\tLas tortugas pueden encontrarse alrededor de los lagos y otros cuerpos de agua en los campos del norte de Bree. Walt Rosablanca quiere que recolectes caparazones de tortuga y se los entregues detrás de las piedras, cerca de las cascadas donde la garganta se une a los lagos. NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.\n",
[2423]="70071AD1\n1\tDerrota a Têzdab el Carnicero\tTêzdab the Butcher is reported as having been last seen in the vicinity of Khanâg Gur in An Shêru.\n2\tTalk to Halshûm in Khanâg Gur\tYou have defeated Têzdab the Butcher. You should return to Khanâg Gur to collect your reward.\n",
[2424]="7006C6D1\n1\tDefeat Uzukar\tA bounty notice in Ub Nishir has asked for someone to defeat a ferocious jackal known as Uzukar who has been spotted near Urgudag to the west.\n2\tReturn to Neshurga and inform him of Uzukar's defeat\tReturn to Neshurga in Ub Nishir north of Maurûsh and inform him that you have completed the bounty and defeated Uzukar.\n",
[2425]="700358E2\n1\tDerrota a Vîz y recoge su yelmo\tPuedes encontrar a Vîz acampando cerca de una roca con forma de colmillo en Los Barbechos; para llegar, sigue el camino hacia el sur durante un tramo. Debes invocar y derrotar a Vîz, y recoger su yelmo.\n2\tLleva el yelmo a Britric\tBritric está en Forlaw. Has recogido el yelmo de Vîz, y ahora debes regresar a Forlaw para cobrar tu recompensa.\n",
[2426]="7005FFA3\n1\tCollect war dispatches from the Angmarim in Câr Bronach (total: 4)\tAngmarim can be found in Câr Bronach. A bounty posted by Mézto promises a bounty for the collection of war dispatches from the Angmarim in Câr Bronach.\n2\tDeliver the war dispatches to Mézto at Grúmachath\tMézto can be found at Grúmachath. You have collected a sufficient number of wicked daggers and should now deliver them to Mézto for a bounty.\n",
[2427]="70053DBC\n1\tDefeat wargs in Arandor (total: 7)\030Defeat pack-masters in Arandor (total: 3)\tWargs can be found patrolling the waste-lands in Arandor. You should defeat wargs and pack-masters.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated wargs.\n",
[2428]="70053DBA\n1\tDefeat pack leaders in Rath Dúath (total: 3)\030Defeat pack wargs in Rath Dúath (total: 6)\tWarg packs can be found in Rath Dúath. You should defeat pack leaders and pack wargs.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated warg packs.\n",
[2429]="700413BE\n1\tDefeat Orcs in Ringló Vale (total: 12)\tOrcs can be found throughout Ringló Vale. Defeat Orcs in Ringló Vale.\n2\tCompletado\tDefeated Orcs in Ringló Vale.\n",
[2430]="7005FFA4\n1\tCollect wicked daggers from evil hillmen in Câr Bronach (total: 8)\tEvil hillmen can be found in Câr Bronach. A bounty posted by Lísek promises a bounty for the collection of wicked daggers from evil hillmen in Câr Bronach.\n2\tDeliver the wicked daggers to Lísek at Grúmachath\tLísek can be found at Grúmachath. You have collected a sufficient number of wicked daggers and should now deliver them to Lísek for a bounty.\n",
[2431]="7001AF99\n1\tLleva las calaveras a Edith Rosadulce\030Recolecta calaveras de tumulario (total: 10)\tLos tumularios pueden encontrarse por todas las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur. La guía, Edith Rosadulce, valora las calaveras de tumulario y te pagará por ellas. Está acampada en el Alto del Hombre Muerto, donde las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte se encuentran con las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur. NOTA: Las misiones de recompensa son repetibles, pero tienen un número limitado de completaciones. Esta misión puede completarse tres veces.\n",
[2432]="70053DC5\n1\tDerrota a los espectros en Emyn Duir (total: 9)\030Defeat banner-wights in Emyn Duir (total: 3)\tSe pueden encontrar espectros en Emyn Duir. Deberías derrotar a los espectros.\n2\tCompletado\tYou defeated wights.\n",
})
